## Code Example

```java
@Test
void testIdempotency() {
    String idempotencyKey = UUID.randomUUID().toString();

    Response first = given()
        .contentType("application/json")
        .body(jobPayload)
        .header("Idempotency-Key", idempotencyKey)
        .post("/jobs");

    Response second = given()
        .contentType("application/json")
        .body(jobPayload)
        .header("Idempotency-Key", idempotencyKey)
        .post("/jobs");

    assertEquals(first.jsonPath().getString("jobId"), 
                 second.jsonPath().getString("jobId"));
}

@Test
void testRetryWithBackoff() {
    String jobId = submitJob();

    await().atMost(30, TimeUnit.SECONDS)
           .until(() -> getStatus(jobId).equals("DONE"));

    verify(retries, times(3));
    verify(backoff, times(2)); // exponential: 1s, 2s
}
```

